#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:2
msgid "Visualization"
msgstr "可视化"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:6
msgid ""
"Isaac Lab provides 5 visualizers for real-time simulation inspection and "
"debugging. Where renderers produce sensor data for training, visualizers "
"give fast, lightweight feedback for human monitoring and recording. "
"Visualizers can also stream that same sensor data through the streaming "
"camera panel."
msgstr ""
"Isaac Lab 提供了 5 "
"种可视化器，用于实时查看和调试仿真。渲染器负责生成训练所需的传感器数据，而可视化器则提供快速、轻量的画面反馈，方便人工观察和录制。可视化器也可以通过相机流面板显示同样的传感器数据。"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:11
msgid "This page covers:"
msgstr "本页介绍："

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:13
msgid "`Quick Start`_: launch a visualizer with ``--viz``"
msgstr "`快速入门 <Quick Start_>`_ ：通过 ``--viz`` 启动可视化器"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:14
msgid "`Visualizer Overview`_: each visualizer in its own section"
msgstr "`可视化器概览 <Visualizer Overview_>`_ ：逐一介绍各个可视化器"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:15
msgid "`Shared Features`_: what's common across visualizers"
msgstr "`共有功能 <Shared Features_>`_ ：各可视化器的通用功能"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:16
msgid "`Usage`_: common CLI and config recipes"
msgstr "`使用方法 <Usage_>`_ ：常用命令行参数和配置示例"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:17
msgid "`Limitations`_: per-visualizer differences and troubleshooting"
msgstr "`限制 <Limitations_>`_ ：各可视化器的差异和故障排查"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:117
msgid "Quick Start"
msgstr "快速开始"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:119
msgid ""
"Pass ``--viz`` to any train command to launch a visualizer. ``--visualizer``"
" is an equivalent alias."
msgstr "在任意训练命令中加入 ``--viz`` 即可启动可视化器。 ``--visualizer`` 是等效的别名。"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:0
msgid "uv (Recommended)"
msgstr "uv（推荐）"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:0
msgid "isaaclab.sh / isaaclab.bat"
msgstr "isaaclab.sh / isaaclab.bat"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:151
msgid ""
"Most tasks default to a PhysX backend, which requires Isaac Sim. If it isn't"
" installed yet, add ``--extra isaacsim`` to the ``uv run`` commands above; "
"see :ref:`installation-optional-extras` for details."
msgstr ""
"大多数任务默认使用 PhysX 后端，需要安装 Isaac Sim。如果尚未安装，请在上述 ``uv run`` 命令中加入 ``--extra "
"isaacsim`` ；详情见 :ref:`installation-optional-extras` 。"

