#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:887
msgid "**Lighting differences across visualizers**"
msgstr "**各可视化器的光照差异**"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:889
msgid ""
"Each backend lights the scene differently, so the same environment can look "
"noticeably different across visualizers. Kit renders the scene's actual "
"authored USD lights. Newton GL uses a fixed sky-gradient and single "
"directional light color "
"(:attr:`~isaaclab_visualizers.newton.NewtonVisualizerCfg.sky_upper_color`, "
"``sky_lower_color``, ``light_color``), independent of scene USD lights. "
"Newton RTX supports only 3 lighting-environment presets "
"(:attr:`~isaaclab_visualizers.newton.NewtonRTXVisualizerCfg.rtx_environment`:"
" ``\"default\"``, ``\"studio\"``, ``\"none\"``) and does not use any scene-"
"authored USD lights. Viser uses a single ambient light with no directional "
"key light, so scenes tend to look darker and flatter than the other "
"backends. Rerun uses fixed built-in viewer shading with no scene-driven "
"lighting."
msgstr ""
"各后端的光照方式不同，因此同一环境在不同可视化器中可能呈现明显不同的效果。Kit 渲染场景中实际编写的 USD 灯光。Newton GL "
"使用固定的天空渐变和单个方向光颜色（ "
":attr:`~isaaclab_visualizers.newton.NewtonVisualizerCfg.sky_upper_color` 、 "
"``sky_lower_color`` 、 ``light_color`` ），不受场景 USD 灯光影响。Newton RTX 仅支持 3 "
"种光照环境预设（ "
":attr:`~isaaclab_visualizers.newton.NewtonRTXVisualizerCfg.rtx_environment` "
"： ``\"default\"`` 、 ``\"studio\"`` 、 ``\"none\"`` ），不使用场景中编写的 USD 灯光。Viser "
"只使用单个环境光，没有方向主光，因此场景通常比其他后端更暗、更缺乏层次。Rerun 使用查看器内置的固定着色方式，不由场景灯光驱动。"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:900
msgid "**Kit: incompatible with ovphysx / ovrtx presets**"
msgstr "**Kit：与 ovphysx / ovrtx 预设不兼容**"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:902
msgid ""
"``--viz kit`` cannot be used with ``presets=ovphysx`` or ``presets=ovrtx`` "
"in the same process. Use ``--viz newton_gl``, ``--viz rerun``, or ``--viz "
"viser`` with those presets, or omit ``--viz`` for headless execution."
msgstr ""
"``--viz kit`` 不能在同一进程中与 ``presets=ovphysx`` 或 ``presets=ovrtx`` "
"配合使用。请在这些预设下使用 ``--viz newton_gl`` 、 ``--viz rerun`` 或 ``--viz viser`` "
"，也可以省略 ``--viz`` 进行无界面运行。"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:906
msgid "**Newton RTX: incompatible with Kit**"
msgstr "**Newton RTX：与 Kit 不兼容**"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:908
msgid ""
"``--viz newton_rtx`` raises a ``RuntimeError`` at startup if the active "
"physics backend is ``isaacsim_physx`` (i.e. ``presets=isaacsim_physx``), "
"since OVRTX is a kitless renderer and cannot share a process with Kit. "
"``presets=ovphysx`` is itself kitless and remains supported. Use "
"``presets=newton_mjwarp,ovrtx`` or ``presets=ovphysx,ovrtx`` with ``--viz "
"newton_rtx``, or switch to ``--viz newton_gl``, ``--viz viser``, ``--viz "
"rerun``, or ``--viz kit`` with a Kit-compatible physics backend."
msgstr ""
"如果启用的物理后端是 ``isaacsim_physx`` （即 ``presets=isaacsim_physx`` ）， ``--viz "
"newton_rtx`` 会在启动时抛出 ``RuntimeError`` ，因为 OVRTX 不依赖 Kit，不能与 Kit 共用进程。 "
"``presets=ovphysx`` 本身不依赖 Kit，仍受支持。请将 ``--viz newton_rtx`` 与 "
"``presets=newton_mjwarp,ovrtx`` 或 ``presets=ovphysx,ovrtx`` 配合使用，或者改用 "
"``--viz newton_gl`` 、 ``--viz viser`` 、 ``--viz rerun`` ；也可以在兼容 Kit 的物理后端下使用"
" ``--viz kit`` 。"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:915
msgid "**Rerun: large environment performance**"
msgstr "**Rerun：大量环境下的性能**"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:917
msgid ""
"The Rerun web viewer may slow down or crash with many environments. Reduce "
"load with ``--num_envs``:"
msgstr "环境较多时，Rerun 网页查看器可能变慢或崩溃。可通过 ``--num_envs`` 降低负载："

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:934
msgid "**Rerun: blank page until the first payload loads**"
msgstr "**Rerun：首批数据加载前页面为空白**"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:936
msgid ""
"The Rerun browser tab opens blank and stays that way for several seconds (up"
" to ~10s, depending on scene size) before the scene and live plots appear. "
"This is expected -- it's the time for the web viewer to connect to the local"
" Rerun server and receive its first batch of logged data -- but the page "
"gives no loading indicator in the meantime, so it can look stuck. No action "
"is needed; wait for the first frame to arrive."
msgstr ""
"Rerun 浏览器标签页打开后会先显示空白，几秒后才出现场景和实时曲线（视场景大小而定，最长约 10 秒）。这是正常现象：网页查看器需要连接本地 "
"Rerun 服务器并接收首批日志数据。但在此期间页面没有加载提示，看起来可能像是卡住了。无需操作，等待第一帧到达即可。"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:942
msgid "**Newton GL: CUDA/OpenGL interoperability warnings**"
msgstr "**Newton GL：CUDA/OpenGL 互操作警告**"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:944
msgid ""
"In some configurations, the Newton GL visualizer emits warnings about "
"CUDA/OpenGL interoperability:"
msgstr "在某些配置下，Newton GL 可视化器会输出关于 CUDA/OpenGL 互操作的警告："

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:953
msgid ""
"The visualizer still functions correctly but falls back to CPU copy "
"operations, which reduces performance."
msgstr "可视化器仍能正常工作，但会回退到 CPU 拷贝操作，性能会有所下降。"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:956
msgid "**Newton GL: OpenGL context failures**"
msgstr "**Newton GL：OpenGL 上下文创建失败**"

#: source/concepts/visualization.rst:958
msgid ""
"If pyglet reports that ``glCreateShader`` is not exported or that OpenGL 2.0"
" is required, the process is running without a GPU-backed display context "
"(for example, in a service session or a remote desktop without GPU "
"acceleration). Run from a GPU-backed interactive display session, or omit "
"``--viz newton_gl`` for headless execution."
msgstr ""
"如果 pyglet 提示 ``glCreateShader`` 未导出，或需要 OpenGL 2.0，说明进程运行时没有 GPU "
"支持的显示上下文（例如服务会话，或未启用 GPU 加速的远程桌面）。请在具有 GPU 支持的交互式显示会话中运行，也可以省略 ``--viz "
"newton_gl`` ，改为无界面运行。"

